1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,643
This demonstration shows the real Spideli customer app,

2
00:00:03,643 --> 00:00:07,958
running in a private test environment with fictional customers and test money.

3
00:00:08,408 --> 00:00:12,484
The narration voice is computer generated. There is no human presenter.

4
00:00:13,984 --> 00:00:19,094
Welcome to this walkthrough of Spideli Finance, the money module of the Spideli customer app.

5
00:00:19,544 --> 00:00:25,231
We will follow Amina, a sample customer, as she uses her wallet, sends money, pays bills,

6
00:00:25,231 --> 00:00:30,727
saves with her family and her community, invests, and protects herself with insurance.

7
00:00:31,177 --> 00:00:36,177
Everything you see is the real app, connected to a private test environment with test money.

8
00:00:37,677 --> 00:00:40,454
Spideli Finance opens on Amina's dashboard.

9
00:00:40,904 --> 00:00:44,410
At the top is her available balance in Central African francs,

10
00:00:44,410 --> 00:00:46,502
with her other currencies just below.

11
00:00:46,502 --> 00:00:50,630
The eye icon hides the amounts when someone is looking over her shoulder.

12
00:00:51,080 --> 00:00:56,560
The four round buttons are her everyday actions: add money, send, pay bills, and withdraw.

13
00:00:57,010 --> 00:01:00,384
Further down, Coming up reminds her of her next payment,

14
00:01:00,384 --> 00:01:02,974
This month compares money in and money out,

15
00:01:02,974 --> 00:01:07,914
and Your money summarizes her savings, investments, loans, tontines and insurance.

16
00:01:09,414 --> 00:01:13,677
The Services tab groups every finance service by what it helps you do:

17
00:01:13,677 --> 00:01:17,576
pay and send, save and invest, borrow and protect, and get help.

18
00:01:21,079 --> 00:01:24,098
The Wallet tab shows her full history, grouped by day.

19
00:01:27,602 --> 00:01:30,376
She can search by reference, filter by type,

20
00:01:30,376 --> 00:01:34,601
and open any transaction to see its details and copy its reference.

21
00:01:39,154 --> 00:01:41,402
Now Amina withdraws money to Mobile Money.

22
00:01:42,352 --> 00:01:46,107
If she asks for more than she has, the app tells her straight away,

23
00:01:46,107 --> 00:01:48,293
and the Continue button stays disabled.

24
00:01:49,243 --> 00:01:52,513
For twenty thousand francs, the fee is calculated for her,

25
00:01:52,513 --> 00:01:56,234
and she sees exactly what she receives and what leaves her wallet.

26
00:01:57,184 --> 00:02:02,267
She chooses her saved Orange Money number and confirms. The request is now in progress.

27
00:02:03,217 --> 00:02:05,670
When Spideli's operations team pays it out,

28
00:02:05,670 --> 00:02:09,036
the page updates on its own and shows the payout reference.

29
00:02:11,036 --> 00:02:13,860
Sending money to another Spideli customer is instant.

30
00:02:17,174 --> 00:02:20,567
Amina enters Jean's email address. Before anything is paid,

31
00:02:20,567 --> 00:02:23,213
the app checks the account and shows his name,

32
00:02:23,213 --> 00:02:26,203
so she knows the money is going to the right person.

33
00:02:29,517 --> 00:02:32,468
Transfers between customers are free. She confirms,

34
00:02:32,468 --> 00:02:36,518
pays from her wallet, and the money is in Jean's wallet straight away.

35
00:02:40,883 --> 00:02:45,756
Paying a bill takes just a few taps. Amina chooses electricity and her provider.

36
00:02:54,110 --> 00:02:57,300
A meter number in the wrong format is caught before she pays.

37
00:03:05,654 --> 00:03:09,449
She pays fifteen thousand francs, and the payment is processing.

38
00:03:17,803 --> 00:03:19,430
Once the provider confirms,

39
00:03:19,430 --> 00:03:24,132
her prepaid electricity code appears on the receipt, with a button to copy it.

40
00:03:33,537 --> 00:03:36,238
Amina can also hold euros and US dollars.

41
00:03:37,938 --> 00:03:39,978
The converter uses the published rate,

42
00:03:39,978 --> 00:03:44,057
and shows the fee and the exact amount she will receive before she confirms.

43
00:03:46,807 --> 00:03:49,694
Her virtual card can be topped up from her wallet,

44
00:03:49,694 --> 00:03:53,850
given spending limits, and frozen in one tap if she misplaces her phone.

45
00:04:07,311 --> 00:04:10,941
Unfreezing asks for her password, so nobody else can do it.

46
00:04:25,453 --> 00:04:29,726
With collective savings, Amina and her family save towards a shared goal,

47
00:04:29,726 --> 00:04:31,306
here a deposit for a house.

48
00:04:38,723 --> 00:04:43,330
Every member can add money. The app shows the progress and the projected completion date,

49
00:04:43,330 --> 00:04:46,022
and a withdrawal from a group goal becomes a request

50
00:04:46,022 --> 00:04:48,403
that Spideli checks against the group's rules.

51
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:59,739
A tontine is a traditional rotating savings group.

52
00:04:59,739 --> 00:05:05,017
Each member pays the same amount every cycle, and one member receives the whole pot in turn.

53
00:05:06,300 --> 00:05:09,901
Amina already received the first pot. Now it is Jean's turn,

54
00:05:09,901 --> 00:05:12,961
and she pays her contribution for the second cycle.

55
00:05:14,244 --> 00:05:18,248
The app shows who has paid, who receives the pot, and the full schedule.

56
00:05:20,581 --> 00:05:25,179
Members of a group can also lend to each other. Jean asked his tontine for a loan,

57
00:05:25,179 --> 00:05:28,991
the members voted, Amina funded it, and Jean accepted the agreement.

58
00:05:30,691 --> 00:05:34,171
As a lender, Amina sees the terms, the repayment schedule,

59
00:05:34,171 --> 00:05:37,410
the repayments already made, and her share to collect.

60
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:43,429
In Investments, Amina compares funds by risk and fees,

61
00:05:43,429 --> 00:05:46,031
and reads their key facts before investing.

62
00:05:47,731 --> 00:05:52,394
Her portfolio shows its value, what she invested, and her gains or losses.

63
00:05:55,144 --> 00:05:59,813
For insurance, Amina answers a few questions and gets an estimate straight away.

64
00:06:05,929 --> 00:06:09,756
Her family health policy is active, with its premium schedule.

65
00:06:15,872 --> 00:06:19,221
When her daughter needed care, she declared a claim in the app,

66
00:06:19,221 --> 00:06:23,049
answered the insurer's question, and the claim was paid into her wallet.

67
00:06:30,215 --> 00:06:33,851
Things do not always go to plan, and the app is honest about it.

68
00:06:36,381 --> 00:06:37,923
When a payout cannot be made,

69
00:06:37,923 --> 00:06:41,804
the money goes back to the wallet automatically, and the reason is shown.

70
00:06:44,334 --> 00:06:48,082
If the connection is lost while paying, the app does not pretend:

71
00:06:48,082 --> 00:06:53,329
it says the payment is not confirmed. Trying again finishes it, and can never charge twice.

72
00:06:56,909 --> 00:06:59,410
Behind the screens, every movement of money is

73
00:06:59,410 --> 00:07:02,346
recorded in Firebase as a debit and a matching credit.

74
00:07:02,796 --> 00:07:04,231
In this test environment,

75
00:07:04,231 --> 00:07:08,993
an independent check confirms that every balance matches its history, to the franc.

76
00:07:09,443 --> 00:07:14,517
Customers only ever see their own records: the security rules refuse everything else.

77
00:07:16,017 --> 00:07:18,826
To finish, here is a complete journey in one go.

78
00:07:30,502 --> 00:07:36,098
Amina opens Spideli Finance, sends five thousand francs to Fatou, sees the confirmation,

79
00:07:36,098 --> 00:07:41,122
and finds the transfer at the top of her recent activity, with all its details.

80
00:07:53,848 --> 00:07:58,005
To sum up, Spideli Finance gives customers one place to hold, send,

81
00:07:58,005 --> 00:08:03,589
save and grow their money, with clear confirmations, live statuses and a complete history.

82
00:08:04,039 --> 00:08:07,482
A few parts depend on partners that are not connected yet.

83
00:08:07,482 --> 00:08:12,172
Adding money by card or Mobile Money needs the payment provider's live account.

84
00:08:12,172 --> 00:08:17,812
Card issuing needs a card issuer. Two step verification by SMS needs to be enabled in Firebase.

85
00:08:17,812 --> 00:08:20,661
And the AI financial coach is not available yet.

86
00:08:21,111 --> 00:08:22,250
Thank you for watching.

